-- A broken element that follows a sibling on its line with no space
-- between them stays there (language.md §11.15), and its children and
-- closing tag hang off the children's column, not its own: a run of such
-- siblings does not step right, one indentation per sibling, which made
-- the output grow as the square of the input.
stairs =
    <div><p>
        one
    </p><p>
        two
    </p><p>
        three
    </p></div>
